# The architecture lens of one example module.
system arch-lens  centering a list of numbers
  covers   lang/viv/features/examples/arch-lens

layer programs  program
  what     the example itself
  modules  lang/viv/features/examples/arch-lens

order  programs

budget def mean_of
  fanin    1
  why      one caller: the centering

budget program lang/viv/features/examples/arch-lens
  modules  1
  defs     2
